              "value": "Error%3A+Hydration+failed+because+the+server+rendered+HTML+didn%27t+match+the+client.+As+a+result+this+tree+will+be+regenerated+on+the+client.+This+can+happen+if+a+SSR-ed+Client+Component+used%3A%0A%0A-+A+server%2Fclient+branch+%60if+%28typeof+window+%21%3D%3D+%27undefined%27%29%60.%0A-+Variable+input+such+as+%60Date.now%28%29%60+or+%60Math.random%28%29%60+which+changes+each+time+it%27s+called.%0A-+Date+formatting+in+a+user%27s+locale+which+doesn%27t+match+the+server.%0A-+External+changing+data+without+sending+a+snapshot+of+it+along+with+the+HTML.%0A-+Invalid+HTML+tag+nesting.%0A%0AIt+can+also+happen+if+the+client+has+a+browser+extension+installed+which+messes+with+the+HTML+before+React+loaded.%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Freact.dev%2Flink%2Fhydration-mismatch%0A%0A++...%0A++++%3CRenderFromTemplateContext%3E%0A++++++%3CScrollAndFocusHandler+segmentPath%3D%7B%5B...%5D%7D%3E%0A++++++++%3CInnerScrollAndFocusHandler+segmentPath%3D%7B%5B...%5D%7D+focusAndScrollRef%3D%7B%7Bapply%3Afalse%2C+...%7D%7D%3E%0A++++++++++%3CErrorBoundary+errorComponent%3D%7Bundefined%7D+errorStyles%3D%7Bundefined%7D+errorScripts%3D%7Bundefined%7D%3E%0A++++++++++++%3CLoadingBoundary+hasLoading%3D%7Bfalse%7D+loading%3D%7Bundefined%7D+loadingStyles%3D%7Bundefined%7D+loadingScripts%3D%7Bundefined%7D%3E%0A++++++++++++++%3CNotFoundBoundary+notFound%3D%7Bundefined%7D+notFoundStyles%3D%7Bundefined%7D%3E%0A++++++++++++++++%3CRedirectBoundary%3E%0A++++++++++++++++++%3CRedirectErrorBoundary+router%3D%7B%7B...%7D%7D%3E%0A++++++++++++++++++++%3CInnerLayoutRouter+parallelRouterKey%3D%22children%22+url%3D%22%2Feu%2Fstock%22+tree%3D%7B%5B...%5D%7D+childNodes%3D%7BMap%7D+...%3E%0A++++++++++++++++++++++%3CEuropeStockPage%3E%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++%3CStockPage%3E%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++++%3CLayout+title%3D%22Nos+V%C3%A9hicu...%22%3E%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++++++%3CNoopHead%3E%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++++++%3Cdiv+className%3D%22flex+flex-...%22%3E%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++%3CHeader%3E%0A